#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:11
#: 6a116204cf4945e8bb14decec9215068
msgid "**X7/X7 Pro/X7+/X7+ Pro®** is an advanced autopilot family designed in-house by CUAV®. It uses a higher-performance STM32H7 processor and integrates industrial-grade sensors. Compared with previous autopilots, it has better performance and higher reliability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:13
#: e4ffe49626d64fb1ad176e75e2e10a87
msgid "The first generation autopilots (X7/X7 Pro) have been updated with new sensors, providing the same high performance, but with more reliable source of supply, and some improvements to allow Bi-dir DShot and servo rail voltage monitoring."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-x7-family-overview.rst:15
#: 2c4b0e8c5e72487fa8bf8f86cb90216f
msgid "The modular design allows users to customize the baseboard and is fully compatible with the CUAV V5+ carrier board. The X7+/X7+ Pro are ideal for academic research and commercial systems integration."
msgstr ""

